---
description: Defaults for Cursor rule files
globs: ".cursor/rules/**/*.mdc"
alwaysApply: false
---

- A project rule is an `.mdc` file with YAML frontmatter.
- Set `alwaysApply` to true only when the rule belongs in every session.
- For a file-specific rule, set `alwaysApply` to false and set `globs`.
- For a rule the agent should pull in by topic, set `alwaysApply` to false, set `description`, and omit `globs`.
